  "about": "Official Bonsai 2 9B Q2_0 packing on one 8 GB laptop card with its full 262,144-token context: upstream llama.cpp b11681 (the Bonsai Hadamard runtime), q4_0 KV (only 8 of 32 layers hold KV), batch 2048 / ubatch 512, everything on the GPU. In 30 s runs of the lab's speed prompt on an RTX A2000 8GB Laptop GPU at 35 W: 32K f16 (the cuda12 launch) 45.0, 64K f16 45.8, 128K q8_0 45.3, 256K q8_0 45.3 (7,867 MiB, too close to the card's 7,893), 256K q4_0 45.4 tok/s at 5,819 MiB. At 256K q4_0 with a 64K-token prompt, ubatch 128 / 256 / 512 prefilled 639 / 676 / 714 tok/s at the same decode speed (6,053 MiB with ubatch 512). Lab run with this launch (all six gates): 44.9 tok/s decode, 459 tok/s prefill, MemAvailable drop 3.96 GB (1 GB in the speed-only runs). An earlier lab during tuning ran 45.3 tok/s and 391 tok/s prefill. Generation and thinking are uncapped.",
